KEY MATERIAL

keys/szl-audit-ed25519.pub.pem is a PUBLIC verification key, published so third
parties can verify estate audit receipts offline. No private key material is
present in this repository, and none may ever be committed to it.

VERIFICATION BOUNDARY

A signed estate-audit receipt proves integrity and origin of the audit record —
that these values were observed and signed at that time. It does NOT prove the
estate is secure, compliant, or correct. Λ = Conjecture 1 (advisory; uniqueness
open) — never "proven trust." Absent evidence is reported as UNKNOWN, never
converted into a pass.
